<view class="container">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">市场部工作台</view>
    <view class="subtitle">把部门发给你的链接粘贴进来，只用填一次。</view>

    <input
      class="input"
      placeholder="粘贴你的专属链接或口令"
      value="{{link}}"
      bindinput="onInput"
      confirm-type="done"
      bindconfirm="submit"
    />

    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="muted" style="color:#b42318; margin-top:16rpx;">{{error}}</view>

    <button class="btn" style="margin-top:24rpx;" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy}}">
      {{busy ? '正在验证…' : '进入'}}
    </button>

    <view class="muted small" style="margin-top:20rpx;">
      链接由部门负责人发出；忘记或没有链接，问部门负责人。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
